From 075a67b613dac6b88a0a4b4674df59f92b72d92e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: priangle <203159732+priangle@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:05:14 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] crt-emu: rename PC-CRT to crt-emu (files, identifiers,
 markers, panel title)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The project is now called crt-emu. No behaviour changes:
- src/pccrt/pccrt_osd.cpp -> src/crtemu/crtemu_osd.cpp,
  inc/pccrt_osd.h -> inc/crtemu_osd.h (Makefile follows).
- Identifiers pccrt_* / g_pccrt_* / PCCRT_* -> crtemu_* / g_crtemu_* /
  CRTEMU_*; environment variables of the panel host test:
  CRTEMU_OSD_SCALE, CRTEMU_OSD_FONT.
- Edits are marked with "crt-emu" comments instead of "PC-CRT".
- In-game panel title: "crt-emu · кинескоп".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015yjP4pBYqkzwik2NkFF1dK
